{{Finnish index|j}}

===Etymology===
*From ''jompi-'' and ''[[kumpi]]'' &ndash; which are related to the stems ''jo-'' and ''-ku-''.

===Pronunciation===
*Hyphenation: jom•pi•kum•pi

===Pronoun===
'''jompikumpi'''

# {{indefinite|lang=fi}} [[either]] [[one]]:
#:*''Jompikumpi'' teistä valehtelee.
#:**''Either one'' of you lies.

====Inflection====
*Both the parts are declined.

